<title>JAPAN: Japan 1996/97 GDP rises real 3.0 pct --- EPA.</title>
<headline>Japan 1996/97 GDP rises real 3.0 pct --- EPA.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's gross domestic product (GDP), the total output of goods and services minus net income from overseas production, rose a real 3.0 percent in fiscal 1996/97 from the previous year, the Economic Planning Agency (EPA) said on Friday.</p>
</text>
